{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the controllable chaos of a neighborhood where danger lurks around every corner and bullets fly! It's an all-out shootout! In this third-person shooter, you won't face zombies or space monsters, but rather the most real enemies: on-duty thugs and corrupt politicians trying to ruin the community's day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>4 unique characters</strong>, each with their own arsenal and style to take down the bad guys\u2014a true gunpowder party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission?</strong> <strong>Defend the local school at all costs!</strong> With each wave, groups of ill-intentioned individuals will come in force. But don't worry, you're not alone! Use your &quot;luletas&quot; to improve the school's defenses, transforming it into an impenetrable fortress... or almost!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823930?t=1751322663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823930/430685aa372a3e34a68e1950e4c89bbca4449659/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751322663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823930/bb00dd2b5f2bf86cfe01b9a19d54e48708900a81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751322663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823930/bb00dd2b5f2bf86cfe01b9a19d54e48708900a81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751322663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Violence and blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the controllable chaos of a neighborhood where danger lurks around every corner and bullets fly! It's an all-out shootout! In this third-person shooter, you won't face zombies or space m